### Cadastro -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rafhael Viana",
  "username": "rafhael",
  "email": "rafhael@example.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### Cadastro com email já usado -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro Usuário",
  "username": "outro",
  "email": "rafhael@example.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### Cadastro com senha curta -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rafhael Viana",
  "username": "rafhael2",
  "email": "rafhael2@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login por email -> 200 (retorna token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "rafhael@example.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### Login por username -> 200 (retorna token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "rafhael",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### Login com senha errada -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "rafhael@example.com",
  "password": "senhaerrada"
}
